WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:07.400
Elmau Palace at the foot of the Wetterstein mountains on Germany's southern border.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.703
It's an enchanting location that attracts
not only tourists

00:00:10.703 --> 00:00:14.900
but some of the world's finest musicians.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:24.400
Famous visitors have included Benjamin Britten,
London's legendary Amadeus Quartet

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.419
and violin virtuoso Yehudi Menuhin.

00:00:29.419 --> 00:00:34.739
There are more than 200 top flight evening
concerts at Elmau Palace every year, mostly

00:00:34.739 --> 00:00:38.239
featuring jazz and classical music.

00:00:38.239 --> 00:00:40.500
Sometimes there's chamber music.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.947
Here guests are treated to a quartet with
violinist Lisa Batiashvili

00:00:44.947 --> 00:00:48.700
and violist Antoine Tamestit.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.489
“Elmau palace is my favorite place in the
world.

00:00:55.489 --> 00:00:57.120
Time passes differently here.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.760
The air is different.

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:01.200
It's a world unto itself.”

00:01:02.219 --> 00:01:05.400
Musicians here don't get paid their usual
appearance fees.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.940
Instead they get a couple of days free residence,
including gourmet food.

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:14.119
“Food is something essential for the artists
who come here.

00:01:14.119 --> 00:01:17.399
For them, everything aesthetic and sensual
is of the highest importance.

00:01:17.399 --> 00:01:21.300
They're the most discerning guests a hotel
can have .”

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:28.549
And the man in charge of the guests' culinary
well-being is Mario Corti.

00:01:28.549 --> 00:01:33.619
He's been Elmau Palace's executive chef since
2010.

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:39.670
The hotel's flagship restaurant is the Luce
d‘ Oro, a tiny gourmet eatery seating 35.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:43.200
It's had a Michelin star for several years.

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:56.759
“A gourmet restaurant is great advertising
for a complete culinary concept.”

00:01:56.759 --> 00:02:00.799
But Corti is also responsible for everything
some 70 chefs serve

00:02:00.799 --> 00:02:03.899
in the hotel's eight other restaurants.

00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:07.500
“We cook very international food.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:10.000
We don't want to limit ourselves to any one
style,

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.600
say classic French with Euro-Asian influences.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:14.930
We use seasonal products.

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:19.600
We cook with passion using many ingredients
from the region.”

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:24.749
One of the most popular dishes is filet of
Wagyu beef

00:02:24.749 --> 00:02:29.610
with white and green asparagus and potatoes.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:34.730
“Here we have some wonderful Wagyu Beef.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:38.140
It comes from our friend Sepp Krätz at the
German Wagyu Academy.

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:42.690
It's one hundred percent pure Wagyu beef,
born and bred in Bavaria.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:43.930
It's wonderfully marbled.”

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:51.800
“Preheat the oven to 90 degrees Celsius
then bake the seared meat for around 12 minutes.

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:54.000
Then let it stand briefly.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:57.200
Sautee it again in butter, and you've got
the perfect steak.”

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:02.560
“Here's some grade A asparagus, juicy and
just harvested.”

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.382
“You glaze the asparagus very slowly, with
a bit of salt,

00:03:06.382 --> 00:03:11.350
a pinch of sugar and some poultry stock.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:15.930
It's cooked through very slowly in its own
juices.”

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:24.310
Here we have some nice potatoes from the region
cut into squares.

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:27.900
We fry them slowly so that roasting aromas
can develop.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:29.780
Just adding a little butter and some parsley.

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:33.695
Cherry tomatoes, radishes, some herbs and
a lug of good olive oil

00:03:33.695 --> 00:03:36.900
give the whole thing some freshness."

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:42.980
Filet of Wagyu beef with asparagus is a luxurious
dish.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:47.200
The meat costs several hundred euros a kilo.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:59.130
The food and the music are a perfect combination.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:07.160
“It rare to spend the whole day in the same
place as the audience.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:12.620
You meet people in the restaurant, in the
spa or outside.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:15.970
It feels very natural.

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:18.010
Very intimate.

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:21.000
It's fun sharing you're music with these people.”

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:27.639
The fine food and fine music of Elmau Castle
are no secret.

00:04:27.639 --> 00:04:31.900
Enthusiasts flock to this remote and enchanting
location.

